#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:3
msgid "Contacts and Private Calls"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:5
msgid ""
"Private calls provide ad-hoc collaboration sessions outside of channels. Add "
"contacts to your list and start calls with one or more people."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:7
msgid "Adding a Contact"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:9
msgid ""
"In the Collaboration Panel, click the `+` button next to the `Contacts` "
"section"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:10
msgid ""
"Search for the contact using their GitHub handle.  \n"
"_Note: Your contact must be an existing Zed user who has completed the "
"GitHub authentication sign-in flow._"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:12
msgid ""
"Your contact will receive a notification. Once they accept, you'll both "
"appear in each other's contact list."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:15
msgid "Private Calls"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:17
msgid "To start a private call:"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:19
msgid ""
"Click the `...` menu next to an online contact's name in the Collaboration "
"Panel."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:20
msgid "Click `Call <username>`"
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:22
msgid ""
"Once you've begun a private call, you can add other online contacts by "
"clicking their name in the Collaboration Panel."
msgstr ""

#: src/collaboration/contacts-and-private-calls.md:26
msgid ""
"_Private calls work like [channels](./channels.md), without channel-specific "
"features such as channel notes._"
msgstr ""
